<title>MALAYSIA: Southern Bank 1996 net up 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Southern Bank 1996 net up 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 108.18   vs	  68.49</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 33.8    vs	  22.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   395.20   vs	 295.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   173.73   vs	 111.20</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   7.01   vs  less   3.80</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	   12.0    vs	  12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Southern Bank Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
